DESCRIPTION:Blithewold Annual Family Clambake Thursday | August 27 5:00 &#
 8211\; 8:00 PM Location: Event Tent The Great Lawn has been the scene of f
 amily clambakes for over a century! Step back in time and stroll the garde
 ns and grounds. Feast on a traditional Rhode Island clambake while you rel
 ax and enjoy the sunset\, just like so many generations of Blithewold gues
 ts. McGrath Clam Bakes will serve their famous bake\, and a cash bar will 
