 McGrath’s at 401-847-7743. Please note that no outside alcoholic beverag
 es are permitted. Program Agenda: 4:30 PM: Gates open for check-in 5 PM: R
 hode Island “clear broth” quahog chowder station 6:15 PM: Guests invit
