UID:cd67e316cf44f09e5ad6a29b3974@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:We are proud to announce the Puerto Rican Festival in Woonsock
 et\, a vibrant cultural celebration set to take place [August 29\, 2026] a
 t [River Island Park\, Woonsocket\, RI]. This landmark event will bring to
 gether families\, community leaders\, local businesses\, and visitors from
  across Rhode Island and beyond for a day filled with music\, dance\, auth
 entic cuisine\, and cultural pride. Our mission is to redefine the bakery 
 experience in Woonsocket by bringing traditional Puerto Rican Sweets and D
 esserts.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/puerto-rican-fe
 stival/109367/
LOCATION:River Island Art Park\, River Island Art Park\, 57 Bernon St\, Wo
 onsocket\, RI 02895 Time: 12:00 PM to 5:00 PM River Island Art Park\, 57 B
